{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vital Shell Demo Disc</strong> is a science-fantasy survivors-like experience with a distinct PSX-era look, complete with an ambient jungle soundtrack. Take control of your favorite fantasy archetype expressed as a mech. Battle relentless waves of enemies in desolate environments. Equip your shell with unique weapons, traits, and powerful abilities, designing potent builds and synergies with every run.  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928280/extras/a7d36d237e5c195e5c3f5269c5066c34.poster.avif?t=1756154912\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928280/extras/a7d36d237e5c195e5c3f5269c5066c34.webm?t=1756154912\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928280/extras/a7d36d237e5c195e5c3f5269c5066c34.mp4?t=1756154912\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring the first of five levels, Island Ruins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast runs, 20 minutes to reach the level's boss</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the Paladin inspired Koenig Shell</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 Upgradable Weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >14 Unlockable Items and Abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Level up as you progress through waves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select weapons, unique abilities, and traits between waves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Socket weapons with gems to generate powerful effects<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928280/extras/db0